# Restriction checkboxes for BLZ_GridColumns_v1.tt (see Docs/Reference.md section 3).
# Support code for the Columns list of every Blazor grid; it does not depend on a table. The menu offers it on the database, the CLI runs it without -t.
Scope=Database
# The template writes its own path (Services/GridColumns.cs) with an @@@FILE marker; OutputName names the file for a run by hand.
OutputName=Services/GridColumns.cs
# Whole-project generation (codegen generate): the stacks that include this template.
Stacks=Blazor
